  "title": "Europe: TotalEnergies finalizes the acquisition of 50% of a portfolio of flexible power generation assets from EPH",
  "summary": "Paris, April 29, 2026 – TotalEnergies announces the completion of the acquisition agreed on 16 November 2025 of 50% of EPH’s flexible power generation platform in Western Europe. Approved by all competent authorities and by the Boards of Directors of both TotalEnergies and EPH, this transaction leads to the creation of TTEP, the 2nd largest […]",
